#   Updates in working hours: schedule 'Work Hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; schedule Work Hours is not converted; the source of the rule is in zone Servers, and the MX names no zone: give the networks behind Servers with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone WAN, and the MX names no 
#   IPv6 out: the source of the rule is in zone LAN, and the MX names no zone: give the networks behind LAN with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone WAN, and the MX names no zone: give the networks behind WAN with --zone-network
#   default LAN to DMZ: the source of the rule is in zone LAN, and the MX names no zone: give the networks behind LAN with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone DMZ, and the MX names no zone: give the networks behind DMZ with --zone-network
#   default DMZ to WAN: the source of the rule is in zone DMZ, and the MX names no zone: give the networks behind DMZ with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone WAN, and the MX names no zone: give the networks behind WAN with --zone-network
